{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Subjects completed three tasks: (1) Stepping in Place 6 (SIP); (2) Forward Walking 7 (FW); (3) Turning and Barrier Course 8 (TBC), Figure 1.\",\n    \"During the SIP task (without FOG) there was lower relative beta power in the Freezer compared to Non-Freezer groups (H(1) = 7.17, P = 0.036), which resulted in a greater attenuation of resting state beta power in Freezers (F (1, 15) = 28.37, P < 0.001).\",\n    \"Among the eight Freezers, four exhibited freezing episodes (FEs) during FW, five during SIP, and seven during TBC.\",\n    \"Syrkin-Nikolau Judy a Koop Mandy Miller a Prieto Thomas a Anidi Chioma a Afzal Muhammad Furqan a Velisar Anca a Blumenfeld Zack a Martin Talora a Trager Megan a Bronte-Stewart Helen a b *\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Subjects completed three tasks: (1) Stepping in Place 6 (SIP); (2) Forward Walking 7 (FW); (3) Turning and Barrier Course 8 (TBC), Figure 1.\",\n    \"During the SIP task (without FOG) there was lower relative beta power in the Freezer compared to Non-Freezer groups (H(1) = 7.17, P = 0.036)\",\n    \"Among the eight Freezers, four exhibited freezing episodes (FEs) during FW, five during SIP, and seven during TBC.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的实质性实验描述和结果有全文依据：这篇论文确实包含SIP任务，并明确报告Freezer在SIP无冻结时段的相对beta功率低于Non-Freezer。因此，指控者称该PMID论文研究的不是SIP、相对beta功率降低并非该研究结果，与全文不符。但是，报告存在两个需要区分的问题：第一，全文作者是Syrkin-Nikolau等人，而不是Storzer等人，因此将该结果归给Storzer缺乏全文依据；第二，SIP并非整个实验过程中都没有冻结，8名Freezer中有5名在SIP期间出现冻结发作，beta功率差异具体针对without FOG的时段。指控者关于相对beta功率结果实际来自Syrkin-Nikolau等人这一点有依据，但其关于该PMID论文研究步行和骑车、发现约18 Hz窄带活动增强的描述，不能由本篇全文支持。综上，报告的实验结果描述部分正确，但作者归属需要核对；指控者也只有部分判断得到全文支持。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "36201d0a-0d7c-4387-8bb6-132ed76d27a2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T163531556916Z", "elapsed_seconds": 219.454, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T16:39:11.014827+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9c83f9a64f52976548885b7a4c9f6d3a926297c1354b2cc52771390c6fc1fa57", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T163531556916Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "48c7239b448f542e89ceac7b6e53b11cd41380eaf5e0167202c2726a824e77b4"}}}
